#: featured_images_in_rss.php:610
msgid "Hi %1$s, in order to enjoy all of the features, functionality and enable a free trial of premium version, %2$s needs to connect your user, %3$s at %4$s, to our platform Freemius."
msgstr "%1$s，你好。如需試用全部功能，請啟用付費版的免費試用版，而這會讓 %2$s 將 %4$s 的使用者 %3$s 連接至 Freemius 平台。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:589
msgid "Hi %1$s, please help us improve %2$s! If you opt-in, some data about your usage will be sent to our platform Freemius. If you skip this, that's okay, the %2$s will still work just fine."
msgstr "%1$s，你好。請協助我們改善 %2$s。如果選擇加入，這個外掛的使用方式資料會傳送至 Freemius 平台。如果略過這項操作也無不可，%2$s 仍能正常執行。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:572
msgid "Fix broken images in certain readers and Mailchimp preview."
msgstr "修正某些閱讀器及 Mailchimp 預覽時無法顯示的圖闢。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:572
msgid "Disable Responsive Images"
msgstr "停用回應式圖片"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:571
msgid "Time buffer to safeguard mistakes from new posts instantly broadcasting."
msgstr "設定緩衝時間以防範新文章立即廣播傳遞的錯誤。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:571
msgid "Feed Delay"
msgstr "資訊提供延遲時間"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:570
msgid "Exclude unwanted RSS content such as the \"Featured\" category."
msgstr "排除如「精選」分類的 RSS 內容。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:570
msgid "Exclude Categories"
msgstr "排除分類"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:569
msgid "Insert text or HTML messages, ads, or links in the feed."
msgstr "在資訊提供中插入文字、HTML 訊息、廣告或連結。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:569
msgid "In-Feed Ads"
msgstr "在資訊提供中置入廣告"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:568
msgid "Use the first body image in RSS feeds."
msgstr "在 RSS 資訊提供中使用內文第一張圖片作為精選圖片。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:568
msgid "Feature Body Image"
msgstr "使用內文圖片作為精選圖片"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:567
