msgstr "請為外掛進行評分及評論"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:352
msgid "Developed and supported by <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>5 Star Plugins</a> in San Diego, CA"
msgstr "這個外掛由加州聖地牙哥的 <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>5 Star Plugins</a> 開發並提供技術支援"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:349
msgid "Free and premium FAQ and Support contact form available at <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>support.5starplugins.com</a>"
msgstr "如需免費版及付費版外掛的常見問題集或技術支援聯絡表單，請造訪 <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>support.5starplugins.com</a>。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:346
msgid "To view your site’s raw RSS feed, click here: <a href=\"%s/feed/\" target=_blank>/feed/</a>"
msgstr "如需檢視這個網站的原始 RSS 資訊提供，請點擊 <a href=\"%s/feed/\" target=\"_blank\">/feed/</a> 連結。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:343
msgid "Still not seeing images in your feed? Verify featured images are set. Clear your browser and any server caches. Using Feedburner? Be sure to also <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>Ping Feedburner</a> so it refreshes your feed."
msgstr "如果仍然無法看到資訊提供中的圖片，請確認已為文章設定精選圖片，或清理瀏覽器快取或伺服器快取。網站採用的如果是 FeedBurner，請透過 <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>Ping FeedBurner</a> 服務讓 FeedBurner 重新整理網站上的資訊提供。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:340
msgid "If you like this plugin, please <a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>Rate and Review</a> it so others can benefit too."
msgstr "如果外掛對這個網站確有幫助，請為外掛進行<a href=\"%s\" target=_blank>評分及評論</a>，讓其他人也能享受到這個外掛帶來的便利之處。"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:324
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "儲存設定"

#: featured_images_in_rss.php:312
